# Security headers for every page Cloudflare Pages serves.
# A full Content-Security-Policy is deliberately not set yet: Turnstile,
# Supabase, Google sign-in and direct-to-R2 uploads would each need careful
# allowlisting, and a wrong CSP silently breaks uploads. frame-ancestors is
# safe on its own and stops the site being framed (clickjacking).
/*
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'none'
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), geolocation=(), microphone=(), payment=()
